{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB節目《愛‧回家之三代同糖》昨晚（28日）劇情極度催淚，吳若希（Jinny）飾演的萬里，意外發現母親嘉冰（車婉婉飾）從加拿大回港的真正原因，竟是被家人冷待！眼見母親心灰意冷，吳若希一反常態溫情鼓勵，更為助母親入圍歌唱比賽，忍痛將秘密武器拱手相讓給死對頭，母女情大逆轉，場面感人！</p><p>昨晚劇情大逆轉 吳若希意外聽心碎錄音</p><p>在昨晚播出的「會過去的（下）」一集中，嘉冰（車婉婉飾）決定參加《當年好聲音》，更與女兒萬里（吳若希飾）打賭若無法入圍海選便要返回加拿大。然而在海選當日，萬里察覺嘉冰神色有異，更在替她保管電話時，意外聽到加拿大親人傳來的語音訊息。原來嘉冰在加拿大被老公、兒子及孫仔「呼之則來、揮之則去」，感到無人關心，才心碎回港。得知真相的嘉冰一度萌生退賽念頭，情緒崩潰。</p><p>吳若希罕有打氣：我哋唐家女人輸人唔會輸陣</p><p>在嘉冰最心灰意冷之際，女兒萬里不但激動大叫「我 care（你）呀」，更罕有地為母親打氣，說出金句：「我哋唐家女人，輸人唔會輸陣！」為了幫助母親成功入圍，萬里更作出重大犧牲，將自己最珍貴的「湊客秘密武器」，親手送給有份擔任《好聲音》評審的死對頭楊帆（趙浚承飾），只為換取他對母親的幫助。吳若希與車婉婉在劇中欲言又止的委屈與心痛，演活了母女間的複雜情感，演技大獲好評。</p><p>網民大讚內心戲感人：估唔到婉婉咁好戲</p><p>對於這段催淚劇情，網民反應相當熱烈，大讚兩位主角的內心戲非常有層次，完全不像一般處境劇的水平。不少留言指被母女情誼深深打動，紛紛表示：「估唔到婉婉啲內心戲都幾感人。」、「睇到眼濕濕，吳若希今次做得好好！」、「呢段戲好有正劇Feel！」、「唐家女人唔可以輸！好感動！」、「為阿媽可以去到幾盡，就係咁解！」。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_5679888066a925eb805c36.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_18153313096a925ebaa8660.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_17380333396a925ebf35a49.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_19735602676a925ec2d62b1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_5740031856a925ec61a3d5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_16321399126a925ec99fd15.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_626927426a925eccd64e6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_11537336656a925ecfe63bd.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_478546496a925ed29d8fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10_5167060236a925ed5acb68.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/11_2858346486a925ed8a49a0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/12_12475518316a925edc582f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/13_14067800636a925edf106d2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/14_6270706756a925ee23a1ae.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/15_3487625636a925ee579be0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/16_12173322466a925ee8277b4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17_11428787356a925eeb07cb8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_3189668076a925eee243d4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_1460748616a925ef1b0f21.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_13672984896a925ef501b50.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_12396224736a925ef871efa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_8618720196a925efb5be27.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_20453344556a925efe33cad.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T04:38:20.320879+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":974,"images":23,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}